## Product Description

NexusConnect is an enterprise-grade Industrial Internet of Things (IIoT) platform that enables customers to connect, monitor, and manage industrial assets at scale.

### Core Capabilities
1. Device connectivity and management
2. Real-time data ingestion and processing
3. Advanced analytics and machine learning
4. Visualization and dashboards
5. Integration with enterprise systems
6. Edge computing support

